<quiz><question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Finding the total number of different combinations to form a group</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A work group for a project is composed of {@men@} men and {@women@} women. They have to give a presentation to their employers on the progress of the project and only {@numtot@} team members can take part in the presentation.</p>
<p>How many different groups can be made for the presentation if:</p>
<p>1. Exactly 1 man can be in the group?</p>
<p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>2. Exactly 2 men can be in the group?</p>
<p>[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>
<p>3. At most 3 men can be in the group?</p>
<p>[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</p>
<p>4. At least 2 men and 2 women have to be in the group?</p>
<p>[[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
